                              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>            Considers all queries/hits to the API and the result regardless other control voucher rejections (i.e. not admited by partner, not admited by payment method, not atmited for non-first_purchase)</run>
